#. あー、なんか意味なくドキドキしてきた。
msgctxt "0001 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I dunno why, but I've been feeling even more stressed\n"
"out than usual..."
msgstr ""

#. なんかヤバくね？　これってビョーキじゃね？
msgctxt "0002 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "That's bad, right? You think I might be getting sick!?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっとー！　責任者さーん！
#. 病人ですよ、医者に連れてってあげてくださーい！
msgctxt "0003 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Hey! Whoever's in charge around here, I'm sick! Get me\n"
"to a doctor!"
msgstr ""

#. ううっ…連れてってくださいよ…
#. お願いしますって…
msgctxt "0004 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Nng... Please, get me out of here. Please...!"
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Leon"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. こんな桑田クンと一緒に過ごそうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I hang out with Leon while he's like\n"
"this?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おーし、作戦会議すっぞ！
msgctxt "0008 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Alright! We gotta sit down and plan out our strategy!"
msgstr ""

#. なぁ、苗木…
#. オメーが狙ってんのって、どの女？
msgctxt "0009 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "So, Makoto...which girl do you have your eye on?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンと一緒に作戦会議をした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leon and I had a strategy meeting...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leon and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Leon a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
